    meta="Free pool loan calculator: enter the pool quote, term and an example APR to see the monthly payment, total interest and amortization for in-ground or above-ground pool financing.",
    answer="This pool loan calculator estimates the monthly payment on pool financing over terms from three to twenty years using standard amortization. Enter the builder's quote, a term and an example APR; it shows the payment, total interest and a full schedule, and compares terms side by side. Pool loans run longer than most home improvement loans because the amounts are larger, so the total-interest line matters here more than anywhere.",
